{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2021-12-07 15:05:00', 'title': 'POISE® BRAND DONATING UP TO $1 MILLION IN PRODUCT AS PART OF FIRST-EVER TELL-A-THONS SHATTERING POSTPARTUM STIGMAS', 'text': 'CHICAGO, DEC. 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 POISE® BRAND, \xa0THE NUMBER ONE BRAND AND CATEGORY LEADER DEDICATED TO BLADDER LEAKAGE SOLUTIONS,\xa0IS DONATING\xa0TWO BOXES OF\xa0ONE BY POISE®\xa0TO CHARITIES SERVING WOMEN IN NEED FOR EVERY COMMENT SHARED DURING ITS FIRST-EVER TELL-A-THON SERIES THIS DECEMBER.† IN ADDITION TO SUPPORTING CHARITABLE ORGANIZATIONS, INCLUDING NEW MOMS\xa0AND WOMEN IN NEED (WIN)\xa0WITH UP TO $1 MILLION IN PRODUCT, THE ONE BY POISE®\xa0TELL-A-THONS CREATE A FORUM FOR WOMEN TO SHARE WHAT THEY WISH THEY HAD BEEN TOLD ABOUT THE JOURNEY OF MOTHERHOOD AND POSTPARTUM BODY CHANGES.'}